/**
 * Single source of truth for every IPC channel and push-event name.
 *
 * Both the main process (`registerIpcHandler`, `ipcMain.on/emit`,
 * `webContents.send`) and the renderer (`ipcRenderer.invoke/on/send`) are
 * typed against these unions, so a misspelled or unregistered name fails
 * typecheck instead of silently drifting at runtime.
 *
 * NOTE: keep name/value in sync with the actual handlers in
 * `src/main/utils/ipc-*.ts` and the push events in `src/main/core/*`.
 */

